<PageTitle>About Me</PageTitle>

<h3>Nicholas Turco RMT</h3>
<hr/>
<br/>

<p>Nick completed an advanced diploma in Massage Therapy in 2014. He also has a diploma in fitness and health promotion. 
   His background in sports and fitness training allows him to use his knowledge and experience to implement an effective treatment plan. 
   Nick’s treatment style encompasses deeper tissue techniques and methods to therapeutically rehab chronic injuries and ailments. 
   Nick believes that Massage Therapy and patient education are important in reaching his patients’goals. In his spare time, 
   he enjoys reading a good book, listening to podcasts and exercising.</p>
